<title>USA: Glencoe, Ill., won by Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bank.</title>
<headline>Glencoe, Ill., won by Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bank said it won $4.600 million of Glencoe, Ill., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.881 percent.</p>
</text>
